Output output/functions.mp4
Set FontSize 40
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 400ms
Set Shell bash

Hide


Type "./calcx"
Enter

Show
Sleep 2500ms

Type "sqrt(25)"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "log(10, sqrt(25)*20)"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "round(sin(pi + 19 degrees), 2)"
Enter
Sleep 2s
